/**
 * RETIRED — saved for future use. NOT imported by any page.
 *
 * The game-themed theme-toggle from the brutalist pass (commit 65efac7 era):
 *  - Majora's Mask moon icon (light mode)
 *  - Super Mario Sunshine Shine Sprite with front/back coin-flip faces
