 *    star coin-flip spins (rotateY, 1.2s loop) using the two-sided flipper
 *
 * Everything below is self-contained: markup + scoped styles + behavior script.
 * To revive: copy the wanted pieces into the live toggle, or import this
 * component into a page (Astro will then bundle its styles/scripts).
 */
